A {{r|Library}} is a room that must be opened with a key. Items from the {{ip|Library|text=Library item pool}} can be found within, among other things, such as [[Cards and Runes|cards and/or runes]] or even enemies. Libraries have a 5% chance of appearing each floor. Certain Library layouts can only appear after unlocking certain store upgrades from donating to the {{m|Donation Machine}}.

