== Notes ==
* {{dlc|nr}} From the outside, the library is identical in appearance to the {{r|Shop}}. One of the ways they can be distinguished is if Isaac has a mapping item such as {{i|Spelunker Hat}} or {{i|The Compass}}. Generally, the library will be closer to the starting room than the Shop.
** {{dlc|r}} The library now has its own unique door.
* Once all items in the [[Library (Item Pool)|Library item pool]] have been picked up, items from the [[Treasure Room (Item Pool)|Treasure Room item pool]] will appear instead.
* Libraries are particularly useful for acquiring the {{tf|Bookworm}} transformation.
* {{t|NO!|r}} now replaces all [[activated item]]s inside the Library with passive items, which prevents all Library items other than {{i|Book of Virtues|n}} from appearing.

== Trivia ==
* The music that plays in the Library is the same as the one played in [[ending 14]].

